-- The main teams and shows to start with. Team logos are seeded 'unreviewed': they show in previews and never in a
-- sent email until staff set rights to 'licensed'. Colours and short names are used everywhere. Ticketmaster images
-- arrive through catalog sync, also 'unreviewed'. The concert default is our own artwork (public/email).
ON CONFLICT ("kind","key") DO NOTHING;
